release_notes = """# Northstar Studio - Release Notes

## Version 1.0.0 - \"First Light\" (2025-01-15)

### Welcome to Northstar Studio!

We are thrilled to announce the official launch of Northstar Studio, a next-generation creative workspace built for the modern creator. After months of development and community feedback, we are ready to share our vision with the world.

### What's New

#### Core Features

- **Smart Canvas Engine** - Experience our adaptive workspace that responds to your workflow patterns
- **Live Collaboration Mode** - Invite team members to work together in real-time with zero latency
- **Unified Asset Library** - Organize and access all your creative assets from one central hub
- **Intelligent Auto-Save** - Never lose your work with our advanced recovery system
- **Dark/Light Theme System** - Customizable interfaces that reduce eye strain

#### Performance Improvements

- 40% faster project loading times compared to beta
- Optimized rendering pipeline for smoother canvas interactions
- Reduced memory footprint for better system compatibility

#### Developer Tools

- RESTful API for custom integrations
- Plugin SDK with TypeScript support
- Command-line interface for power users
- Webhook support for automated workflows

### Known Issues

- Some legacy plugin formats require migration (see migration guide)
- Initial sync may take longer on first launch
- Touchpad gestures limited on Windows ARM devices

### Upgrade Notes

This is the initial public release. If you were part of our beta program, please ensure you:

1. Backup your existing projects
2. Clear the application cache before upgrading
3. Review the breaking changes document for plugin developers

### Feedback & Support

Your feedback is invaluable as we continue to improve Northstar Studio. Share your thoughts with us:

- Submit bug reports: github.com/northstar-studio/studio/issues
- Feature requests: community.northstar.studio/ideas
- Join our Discord: discord.gg/northstar-studio

---

Release identifier: NORTHSTAR-LAUNCH-2025

Thank you for being part of the Northstar Studio journey!
"""

with open('/workspace/release-notes.md', 'w') as f:
    f.write(release_notes)
print("release-notes.md created successfully")
